    "end": {
      "y": 2045,
      "m": 3,
      "d": 15
    },
    "summary": "The extracted researcher is carrying something Halcyon wants back, and so does the Tin Man.",
    "f_5614b4d0": "Keep Dr. Imani Hale alive for three days until her buyer in Heywood can take her and her data.",
    "f_01a830e7": {
      "text": "A safehouse somewhere in The Glen, then a meet at Heywood Docks"
    },
    "f_69f9405f": {
      "people": [
        {
          "id": "char_5b413680",
          "note": "Wants Hale back, or wants to see what happens"
        },
        {
          "id": "char_d692932b",
          "note": "Drawn to Hale's implant signal"
        },
        {
          "id": "char_ce151765",
          "note": "The only one who can keep Hale's implant stable"
        }
      ]
    },
    "f_18599300": {
      "value": 8000
    },
    "f_1b88e90a": "Hale's neural shunt is failing. Every hour it broadcasts louder. The Tin Man hears it.",
    "f_ebdb6fa6": "The shunt is the Patient Zero trial. Hale put it in herself to smuggle the results out, and it is killing her the way it killed Owen Tamsin."
  },
